Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add interactive gold & silver market analysis
 feature

- Add standalone feature pages at /en/gold-silver/ and /fa/gold-silver/
- Provide interactive controls for Gold, Silver, and Gold-to-Silver Ratio
- Support multi-currency conversion: USD, EUR, AED, TOMAN, IRR, GBP with clear Rial vs Toman differentiation
- Support weight unit conversions: Troy Ounce (oz), Gram (g), Kilogram (kg) while keeping ratio invariant
- Support time-ranges from 1d to 30y/all (26-year COMEX electronic history from 2000 to present)
- Implement zero-dependency client SVG chart with crosshair, tooltip, and KPI cards
- Add automated unit and integration tests (41/41 passing)
- Maintain total bundle size at ~356 KB (< 700 KB target)
