   <section class="card"><h2>Methodology & Data Sources</h2><p>Gold-to-Silver Ratio = Gold price per unit weight / Silver price per same unit weight. The ratio is dimensionless and invariant to currency or weight unit.</p><p><code>1 troy ounce = 31.1034768 grams | 1 kilogram = 1,000 grams</code></p><p class="muted">Reference currency is USD. AED is pegged at 3.6725. EUR and GBP use ECB reference rates. Toman/IRR use Tehran free market exchange rates.</p><p class="muted">Data sources: COMEX futures (via Yahoo Finance) and TGJU archive. Continuous electronic observations available from September 2000 to present.</p></section></main>
